{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0A boy who ran away from home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>\u00a0He finds shelter beneath a bridge and begins to spend each day busking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0In this new daily life, he encounters unexpected people and small yet meaningful events. <br>\u00a0Why did he leave home? <br>\u00a0And how will this short journey come to an end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Enjoy a story that feels like a short musical film, capturing a boy\u2019s quiet journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- This version is a demo version -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contents included in the demo version</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story from Prologue to Day 04<br>Covers the early part of the game\u2019s story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 mini-game stages<br>Includes 2 busking rhythm game stages and 1 composition puzzle stage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The estimated playtime for the demo version is about 20\u201330 minutes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004220?t=1759303408","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004220?t=1759303408","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004220/305ae91f57019b5a8d7dbce5e81179c99deb656f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759303408","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004220/305ae91f57019b5a8d7dbce5e81179c99deb656f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759303408","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime"